                  <span className="hmc-foot-label">Last</span>
                  <span className="hmc-foot-value">{Math.round(yesProb)}p</span>
                </div>
                <div className="hmc-foot-sep" />
                <div className="hmc-foot-item">
                  <span className="hmc-foot-label">24h</span>
                  <span className="hmc-foot-value hmc-foot-change">+0.8p</span>
                </div>
                <div className="hmc-foot-sep" />
                <div className="hmc-foot-item">
                  <span className="hmc-foot-label">Open interest</span>
                  <span className="hmc-foot-value">£42.1k</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="#how-it-works" className="hero-scroll-indicator" aria-label="Scroll down">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="1.5" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round">
            <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </section>

      {/* ── How It Works (comprehensive) ─────────────────────── */}
      <section id="how-it-works" className="hiw-section">
        <div className="hiw-container">
          <div className="smm-badge">HOW IT WORKS</div>
          <h2 className="hiw-title">Price reality. Trade outcomes.</h2>
          <p className="hiw-subtitle">
            Every market is a binary contract priced in real time. The market price <em>is</em> the probability.
          </p>

          {/* Step 1-2-3 cards */}
          <div className="hiw-grid">
            <div className="hiw-card">
              <div className="hiw-step-num">1</div>
              <h3>Choose an event</h3>
              <p>Pick from insurance, climate, health, agriculture, liability, or travel markets — each with contracts across multiple maturities.</p>
            </div>
            <div className="hiw-card">
              <div className="hiw-step-num">2</div>
              <h3>Buy YES or NO</h3>
              <p>The contract price reflects the market-implied probability. Buy at 27p if you believe there's more than a 27% chance the event occurs.</p>
            </div>
            <div className="hiw-card">
